"Vx memory model: sequential consistency with barriers"

(* Every run is one interleaving of the threads, and the threads in one instance of a barrier's
   scope meet at the barrier. run_litmus.py compares a test without data races against this
   model, to check that such a test cannot see weak memory ordering (DRF-SC). *)

include "cos.cat"
include "vx_events.cat"

acyclic po | rf | co | fr | bar as sequential
